1
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,370
I got an offer on my place.

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,710
We could start over, find our style as a couple.

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,500
If I move, how do I know I'll be happy there?

4
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,800
Sounds like our mothers had a few things in common.

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,550
- Tell me more. - Let's just say she did a number on me.

6
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:19,310
My husband ran a few businesses in the Arconia, and Lester worked for him.

7
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:21,720
Lester didn't wanna tell me much about what he did.

8
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,640
He didn't feel good about the job.

9
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,400
But you think somebody killed my husband?

10
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,440
- Could I take you out to dinner? - I have no evidence

11
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,110
that you're actually a good guy.

12
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:33,820
We're just a bunch of rich people hashing out a bet.

13
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:36,860
The same one we were trying to settle the last time we were in that gaming parlor.

14
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:41,490
The night your doorman died, we played for a very big contract.

15
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,410
One of you is planning to build New York City's first casino.

16
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:49,000
I think I'll start renovations with... Oliver's apartment.

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,550
What are you talking about?

18
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,920
That offer on your place was from me.

19
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:55,680
I'm the one buying up all the apartments here.

20
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,300
You're turning The Arconia into a casino? All in.

21
00:01:08,770 --> 00:01:13,940
For thousands of years, men have sung about luck being a lady.

22
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:22,120
In Carmina Burana, Carl Orff obsesses over Fortuna, the goddess of fortune.

23
00:01:22,830 --> 00:01:25,910
Frank Sinatra prayed for luck to be a lady,

24
00:01:25,910 --> 00:01:29,460
but still worried she'd go "blow on some other guy's dice."

25
00:01:30,210 --> 00:01:36,010
Men love to blame anything in their life that they can't control... their bad luck,

26
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,180
on ladies.

27
00:01:39,390 --> 00:01:41,970
Listen, you animals, next round is on me, alright?

28
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:46,480
As long as the scotch isn't old enough to be kissed, or drafted.

29
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:49,190
Uh-oh.

30
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:52,400
Queen of Decor has noticed my cracked leather.

31
00:01:53,030 --> 00:01:54,190
Worst day of my life.

32
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,070
Adds character.

33
00:01:56,780 --> 00:01:57,780
You're just being sweet.

34
00:01:59,110 --> 00:02:01,780
Ah, this place has seen better days. Hey, get lost.

35
00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:02,990
I know what she likes.

36
00:02:02,990 --> 00:02:04,450
Interested in a makeover?

37
00:02:04,450 --> 00:02:09,460
- What are you thinking? Uh, bangs or a shag? - For the casino, you goof.

38
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:13,550
I could help. Give it a woman's touch.

39
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:17,550
Ooh, what about this idea?

40
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:22,350
Let me host a private Ladies' Night in here. Once a month.

41
00:02:22,850 --> 00:02:29,390
A night without cigars... or loud men hitting on us.

42
00:02:34,610 --> 00:02:37,530
Done. I love ladies.

43
00:02:38,490 --> 00:02:42,120
But don't worry, I never hit on 'em unless they want me to.

44
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:46,580
- And if they want you to? - Well, then, I make 'em a drink.

45
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:57,340
We have to move out because of a casino?!

46
00:02:57,920 --> 00:03:01,970
Do you remember what I had to do to hold onto my apartment?

47
00:03:01,970 --> 00:03:03,510
I burned a man.

48
00:03:03,510 --> 00:03:08,600
I set fire to a dear friend! Plus, I bought a Peloton.

49
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:14,360
- Hey! - Hi!

50
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:17,270
Look at this cute place.

51
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:21,570
Oh, I'm taking a dance cardio class,

52
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:24,280
and we're using one of your songs for a routine.

53
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,740
I would show it to you, but it's got a lot of thrusting.

54
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:29,540
- It's not appropriate for a lady. - Unnecessary.

55
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,790
Mabitita, my new old friend,

56
00:03:31,790 --> 00:03:34,080
I got you and however many plus-ones you want

57
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,420
tickets to a party tonight.

58
00:03:35,420 --> 00:03:37,590
I'd totally come with, but we both know I'd just get drunk,

59
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:40,970
and tomorrow I'm in a music video where I have to operate heavy machinery, so...

60
00:03:40,970 --> 00:03:43,630
Thank you so much. I just-- I have a lot of case stuff.

61
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:48,100
No, chica, this is case stuff. It's an impossible invite to get.

62
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:50,890
It's a Ladies' Night for important ladies like moi,

63
00:03:50,890 --> 00:03:52,890
and it's literally in the building.

64
00:03:52,890 --> 00:03:55,690
You get in through like-- like a closet or something,

65
00:03:55,690 --> 00:03:57,770
sort of like a speakeasy. Ooh-la-la.

66
00:03:57,770 --> 00:04:01,900
What? But Nicky's dead. Wait, who's throwing this party?
